error_signature: undefined symbol: __cxa_guard_acquire|__cxa_guard_release|__cxa_guard_abort|operator delete\(void\*\)|vtable for __cxxabiv1
keywords: CMake,link driver language,LINKER_LANGUAGE,clang,clang++,libc++,libc++abi,__cxa_guard,operator delete,vtable,test_package,static library,project C CXX
category: cmake, linking, static-library, test_package
approach: rename-consumer-test-source-to-cpp
rec_1: test_package 中放置至少一个 .cpp 源文件（可仅调用 C API），使目标由 clang++ 驱动链接自动带 C++ 运行时；同步更新 add_executable 与 MANIFEST.yml
forbid_1: 以为 project(x C CXX) / enable_language(CXX) 能改变纯 C 目标的链接驱动——不能，链接驱动由目标源文件语言决定
forbid_2: 手动 target_link_libraries 硬编码 c++/c++abi 库名——跨工具链脆弱
fallback_1: set_property(TARGET t PROPERTY LINKER_LANGUAGE CXX)
